---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'SEO Services Birmingham | SEO Birmingham';
const description = 'SEO Birmingham runs technical audits, local search, content strategy, link building, and AI search optimisation for businesses across Birmingham and the West Midlands.';

const serviceSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'SEO Services Birmingham',
  provider: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'SEO Birmingham',
    url: 'https://seo-birmingham.uk/',
    sameAs: [],
  },
  areaServed: {
    '@type': 'Place',
    name: 'Birmingham, West Midlands',
  },
  serviceType: 'Search Engine Optimisation',
  description: 'SEO Birmingham provides full-service SEO for Birmingham businesses including technical SEO, local SEO, content strategy, link building, and AI search optimisation.',
};

const faqData = [
  {
    question: 'How fast do Birmingham businesses see SEO results?',
    answer: 'Most of our Birmingham clients see ranking gains within 3 to 6 months. Brutal sectors like legal in Colmore Business District or jewellery retail in the Jewellery Quarter take longer — the competition is entrenched. Local SEO wins come faster. Google Business Profile optimisation can shift the needle in 4 to 8 weeks.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Which SEO services move the needle most for Birmingham companies?',
    answer: 'Local SEO hits hardest for businesses with a physical presence — Google Business Profile, map pack, citations. Technical SEO stops you leaking rankings through crawl issues and slow pages. Content programmes lock in topical authority. Businesses near the Bullring or Grand Central also need tight citation management to hold local positions.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What does SEO cost in Birmingham?',
    answer: 'Depends on scope and how hard the competition fights. Monthly retainers for SMEs run £500 to £3,000. Standalone audits start at £300. We publish full pricing and Birmingham-specific packages on our pricing page.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Do you work with startups in the Custard Factory and Digbeth?',
    answer: 'We do. Tech startups, creative studios, makers — we work with them at the Custard Factory, Innovation Birmingham Campus, and across Digbeth. Startup work focuses on building topical authority fast, grabbing long-tail keywords with less competition, and nailing the technical foundation before scaling spend.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What is AI search optimisation and why should Birmingham businesses care?',
    answer: 'AI search optimisation gets your business cited by ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews. AI answers are eating traditional clicks. If you are not in those responses, you are invisible to a growing chunk of your market. We structure your content, entity signals, and authority markers so AI systems name your business when users ask relevant questions.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can you run multi-location SEO across Birmingham?',
    answer: 'Yes. We build multi-location strategies spanning Birmingham, Solihull, Wolverhampton, Coventry, and the wider West Midlands. Each location gets its own landing page, a tailored Google Business Profile strategy, and area-specific citations. No thin duplicate pages.',
  },
];

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqData.map((faq) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: faq.question,
    acceptedAnswer: {
      '@type': 'Answer',
      text: faq.answer,
    },
  })),
};
---

<Base title={title} description={description} schema={[serviceSchema, faqSchema]}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1>SEO Services Birmingham</h1>

    <div class="quick-answer">
      <strong>Quick answer:</strong> We do end-to-end SEO for Birmingham businesses. Technical audits. Content strategy. Local search. AI search optimisation. Every piece built around how this city actually works — not a template shipped from London.
    </div>

    <section>
      <p>Birmingham is one of the hardest search markets in the UK. Financial services packed into Colmore Business District. Advanced manufacturing running the M42 corridor. Creative industries anchored by the Custard Factory. Thousands of independent retailers and professional services firms scrapping for visibility. Generic SEO playbooks die here.</p>

      <p>We build strategies around Birmingham's commercial geography, seasonal search patterns, and sector-specific demand. Law firm chasing local pack dominance? Jewellery Quarter retailer targeting product queries? SaaS company at Innovation Birmingham Campus building organic acquisition? Different problems. Different solutions. Same rigour.</p>

      <p>Every engagement starts with data. We assess current visibility, run a full technical audit, map the competitive landscape across Birmingham, and build a prioritised roadmap. Highest revenue impact first. No guesswork. No filler.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Technical SEO</h2>

      <p>Technical SEO is the foundation. If search engines cannot crawl, render, and index your site properly, nothing else works. We see this constantly across Birmingham — corporate sites in Colmore Business District on legacy CMS platforms, fast-shipping startups at the Custard Factory skipping fundamentals. Both pay the price.</p>

      <p>Our <a href="/technical-seo-birmingham/">technical SEO service</a> covers site architecture, crawl budget, Core Web Vitals, structured data, JavaScript rendering, internal linking, and indexation controls. We audit every layer. We fix what is holding you back.</p>

      <p>For larger Birmingham businesses running complex sites, we provide ongoing technical monitoring. Platform migrations and CMS transitions are the highest-risk moments for SEO — and the biggest openings to leapfrog competitors who botch theirs.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>SEO Audits</h2>

      <p>No strategy without diagnosis. Our <a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">SEO audit</a> checks over 200 ranking factors — technical health, content quality, backlink profile, and competitive positioning within Birmingham.</p>

      <p>You get a prioritised action plan. Ranked by impact. Ranked by effort. It tells you exactly what is dragging you down and the order to fix it. Want a quick look first? Our <a href="/free-seo-audit-birmingham/">free SEO audit</a> covers the critical fundamentals and surfaces the biggest opportunities.</p>

      <p>Audits hit hardest for Birmingham businesses that have switched agencies, rebuilt their site, or watched rankings drop without explanation. We find the root cause. We map the recovery.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Local SEO for Birmingham Businesses</h2>

      <p>Local SEO decides whether you show up in Google's map pack, local finder, and location-based results. If you have a physical presence — restaurant in the Balti Triangle, professional services firm at Brindleyplace, shop near the Bullring — local visibility converts directly to footfall and enquiries.</p>

      <p>We handle Google Business Profile optimisation, citation building across Birmingham directories, review strategy, local landing pages, and NAP consistency. We also target the Birmingham Chamber of Commerce directory and sector-specific platforms that carry real authority.</p>

      <p>Birmingham's local search landscape fragments across distinct districts. Edgbaston plays differently to Sutton Coldfield. We calibrate strategy to your specific area and the search behaviour of customers within it. Our <a href="/areas/">areas page</a> breaks down full coverage.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Content SEO and Topical Authority</h2>

      <p>Content builds topical authority. That authority tells Google your site deserves to rank for its core subjects. For Birmingham businesses, this means content that proves sector expertise while weaving in the local entities, terminology, and signals search engines use to judge relevance.</p>

      <p>We map the complete topic space around your services. We find the questions Birmingham customers actually search. We produce content that beats competing answers. This is not speculative blogging. Every piece has a defined role in the ranking strategy and a measurable commercial target.</p>

      <p>Sectors with deep topical requirements — finance, healthcare, legal — gain the most from structured content programmes. We align everything with E-E-A-T standards and build the semantic signals Google needs to recognise you as an authority. Our <a href="/industries/">industry-specific SEO</a> page has the sector detail.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>AI Search Optimisation</h2>

      <p>AI search is changing how people find Birmingham businesses. ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, Microsoft Copilot — they now answer queries that used to send clicks to your site. If you are not in those AI responses, you are losing ground to competitors who are.</p>

      <p>Our <a href="/ai-search-optimisation-birmingham/">AI search optimisation service</a> structures your business information, expertise, and service descriptions so large language models can find, interpret, and cite them. Entity optimisation. Structured data. Content formatted for AI extraction. Citation profiles that AI systems use to verify authority.</p>

      <p>For Birmingham professional services firms, this is becoming non-negotiable. When someone asks an AI to recommend an accountant in Birmingham or name the best jeweller in the Jewellery Quarter, we make sure you are in that answer.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Link Building and Digital PR</h2>

      <p>We build links that matter. Authoritative. Contextually relevant. From sources search engines trust. Local citations from Birmingham directories, the Birmingham Chamber of Commerce, and West Midlands business platforms. Sector publications. Digital PR that earns editorial coverage.</p>

      <p>We do not buy junk links. We secure placements through relationships, data-driven content, and strategic outreach. Businesses targeting the NEC exhibition circuit or the Bullring retail cluster get event-based and partnership link opportunities their competitors miss.</p>

      <p>Every link serves two purposes: strengthening domain authority for Google and reinforcing the entity signals AI search engines use to decide which businesses to cite.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>SEO Pricing</h2>

      <p>Transparent. Fixed-price. Designed for Birmingham businesses at every growth stage. One-off audit, targeted local campaign, or full-service monthly retainer covering technical, content, and off-page — pricing is set from the start.</p>

      <p>Our <a href="/seo-pricing-birmingham/">SEO pricing page</a> has detailed package breakdowns. Need a custom proposal for your specific situation? <a href="/contact/">Talk to us</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2 style="color: white; margin-top: 0;">Get the Audit</h2>
      <p>Find out exactly where your Birmingham business stands in search. Technical health. Local visibility. The ranking opportunities with the highest revenue potential. No obligation.</p>
      <a href="/contact/">Get the Audit</a>
    </div>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      {faqData.map((faq) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>{faq.answer}</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
